  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "プレハブ小屋（屋内）",
    "id": "55",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「園芸部のひとたちは、畑にいるみたいですねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「そうなんです。ここのプレハブ小屋、園芸部とチア部の掛け持ちで使ってて……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「といっても、チア部は規模が小さいから、団長が交渉して借りたらしいんですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「だから、チア部のものって、何にも残ってないんですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「まだ歴史もなくて……園芸部には、植物図鑑とか栽培のノウハウとか、いろいろ残ってるみたいなんですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「だから団長は、チア部魂をあたしたちに残そうとしてるんでしょうね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「その志があれば、チア部はぜったいになくならないと思って……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「団長はいつも、元気に振る舞おうとしてるのかもしれませんねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「なんて。あのひとはほんとに、能天気ですからねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたし以上に、将来のことは何も考えてなくて、向こう見ずで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたしはほら、ちょっとは常識ある言動をしてますからねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「な、なんですかその怪訝な顔はっ？　あたしはいたって正常ですよーっ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「と、とにかく……あんな団長ですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたしも団長みたいに、明るく楽しく、みんなを応援できるようなひとになりたいなーって思うんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「でないと、チア部の意思は、受け継げませんから。なくなっちゃいますから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「団長は、ひとの夢を応援するのが夢だ、って言ってました」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたしも、そういう性格で。だから自分のことをおろそかにしちゃいがちっていうか……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「自分のことになると、何をやっていいのかわからなくなっちゃって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「団長くらい泰然としてたら、気に病まなくても済むんですけどねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「でも、あたしは夢想ばかりしているただの高校生で、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「ほかの、しっかりと将来の夢がある友達たちと比べると、ちっとも未来に進めてないんですよーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「だから、ひとを応援することに説得力が持てないっていうか、さいきん、迷走しちゃってて？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「それで。つゆりちゃんに相談しようと思ったんですよねーっ？　つゆりちゃんには、きっと……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「身体がよくなったらやりたいことが、たくさんあるはずですから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「アドバイスをもらおうかなーって思ったんです♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「そしたら、妖精を見つけて……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「ふいに昔、妖精みたいな夢物語を信じてたのを思い出しちゃったんですよーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「もっと、冷静になってもよかったんですけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、あたしの将来がどんなものになるか、想像つきますか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「もしかして、あたしに未来はないって感じですかーっ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「へ？　悩んでるあたしなんて、あたしらしくない……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「いつもがむしゃらに、前向きにやることで、ちゃんと未来に進めてた……そうなんでしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「えへへ……♪　そう言ってもらえると、ちょっと嬉しいかもしれません。ううん、すっごく嬉しいです……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「逆に元気づけられちゃいましたねーっ？　あたし、ちょっとドキっとしちゃいましたーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
