    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「まだまだ団長への道のりは長いですねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「チア部魂を受け継ぐまでは、卒業しないでもらいたいくらいですっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-cheer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cheer_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「というか、あのひとの進路とか、就職とかの情報がぜんぜん聞こえてこないんですけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「大丈夫なんでしょうか？　急に不安になってきましたけど？」"
